  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Forms are comprised of four sections:


    <b><u>Caller Info</b></u>

    Basic
    details to identify caller (generated by the system when caller enters the queue).

    <b><u>Parameters</b></u>

    What
    does the caller''s wish entail?

    <b><u>Consequences</b></u>

    How should
    the scales of fate be levelled?

    <b><u>Stamp Field</b></u>

    Approve or
    Deny wish.



    Each Form can be drawn on (via the <b>Pencil</b>), any marking
    inside a checkbox will register that item as selected.



    Using the <b>Eraser</b>
    on any part of a checkbox will automatically clear the entire box.



    The
    <b>Approve</b> & <b>Deny</b> Stamps can be used to finalise a form via the <b>Stamp
    Field</b>.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61064fa2516a0e944933044735159339, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8174395281188801794, guid: 61064fa2516a0e944933044735159339, type: 2}
