  m_text: '<b>Company Protocol</b>

    - Phone System

    - Wish Reqeust Forms

    -
    Chaos Index

    - GeneBucks

    <b>Parameters</b>

    - Material

    - Knowledge

    -
    Heart

    - Harm

    - Enhancement

    - Fate

    <b>Consequences</b>

    -
    Inconvenience

    - Day Ruiner

    - Family Conflict

    - Legal Repercussions

    -
    Hexed

    <b>Emporium Catalogue</b>'
