      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'An incentive program that awards the employee for their performance with
    <b>GeneBucks</b>; a currency that can be used to purchase various tools & trinkets
    from <b>Gene''s Corporate Emporium</b> (see last page).



    <b><u>Reward Values</b></u>

    -
    Correct Parameter - <b>(+20 per Parameter)</b>

    - Meet Daily Quota - <b>(+50)</b>

    -
    Chaos Defecit - <b>(-5 per chaos point under balance)</b>

    - Chaos Surplus
    - <b>(+5 per chaos point over balance)</b>

    - Flawless - <b>(x2 total score)</b>



    Final
    score is converted to GeneBucks and awarded at end of day <b>(10 score points
    per GeneBuck)</b>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61064fa2516a0e944933044735159339, type: 2}
